an 5  in the neoplastic population and more than 95  in  residual follicles  There are scattered small  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID positive T cells  The  morphology and immunophenotype are consistent with B cell lymphoma  best  classified as small lymphocytic lymphoma  Dr A  Louissaint from MGH  Hematopathology has reviewed the lymph nodes and concurs with the  interpretation          Electronically Signed Out By Elena F  Brachtel MD       Consulting Pathologist s    Abner Louissaint MD  PhD    Resident Pathologist   Charlotte I Wen Wang MD  PhD      By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis  certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or  corrected the diagnosis       PROCEDURES ADDENDA  Hormone Receptor Quantitation    QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR HER 2 c erbB 2    Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     Focally  the tumor cells show moderate  2   overexpression of  HER 2 c erbB 2   See note       Note   HER 2 c erbB 2 quantitation  the tumor cells membrane immunoreactivity is  evaluated visually and reported as follows     Do not show overexpression  0 to 1   no minimal immunoreactivity or  incomplete membrane staining of tumor cells     Show moderate  2   overexpression  weak to moderate complete membrane  immunoreactivity in   10  of tumor cells     Show strong  3   overexpression  strong complete membrane  immunoreactivity in   30  of tumor cells     These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by  the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not  been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The  FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this  laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision            Electronically Signed Out By  Atul K Bhan MBBS  MD on REMOVED_DATE 15 15      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  FISH Quantitation Analyisis    