issue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm   respectively  The 2 additional fragments are inked black  The larger  separately received adipose tissue is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  tan pink  soft lymph node measuring 0 1cm to the black inked margin  The  smaller fragment of fibroadipose tissue is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm lymph node which extends to 0 2cm from the black inked margin  The following  representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  to include closest anterior margin and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  to include  closest posterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass to overlying skin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Nipple  en face    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Smaller nodule to include anterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest posterior margin to smaller nodule    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Granular fibrous tissue adjacent to main mass    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Unremarkable breast parenchyma    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire larger separately submitted lymph node  serially sectioned    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire smaller separately submitted lymph node  bisected         PART   BREAST  LEFT  MASTECTOMY       report_end  , No.
