ey have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  24 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 14 09 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a 27 x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm unoriented modified radical mastectomy specimen with an attached REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 3cm axillary tail  The overlying tan pink  unremarkable skin measures REMOVED_DATE x 5 5cm with an eccentrically located unremarkable nipple  The nipple and areola measure REMOVED_DATE x 3 2cm  No scar is appreciated  The deep posterior margin is inked black and sectioned to reveal an ill defined  diffuse fibrous area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm  Within this rubbery fibrous area there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm indurated firm ill defined area located in the upper outer quadrant  coming to within 0 8cm from the posterior  deep  margin and 2 0cm from the overlying skin  Within the surrounding rubbery fibrous tissue  multiple blue dome cysts filled with dark brown cloudy serous fluid are identified averaging 0 3cm in maximum dimension  The remaining parenchyma consists of 40  dense white fibrous tissue and 60  tan yellow lobulated adipose tissue with no additional discrete masses or lesions identified  Within the axilla  multiple lymph nodes ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1 2cm are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  firm indurated area to deep margin C E  surrounding rubbery fibrous area F H  uninvolved parenchyma I  four whole lymph nodes J  four whole lymph nodes K  five whole lymph nodes L  three whole lymph nodes M  four whole lymph nodes Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  JOHN BRANDA  MD                                                                             