ble  The specimen is sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette G  Resident  SHABIN NANJI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Yes.
