rea measuring 7  x 5cm  of greenish blue dye coloration  There are two recent hematoma  cavities in the breast parenchyma  The 6 o clock site demonstrates a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm  recent hematoma cavity  Multiple areas of induration surround this cavity   The second hematoma cavity is located at 10 o clock  also contains a  hematoma mixture of firm white tan tumorous appearing tissue around its  margin   Section code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    nipple   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    tissue adjacent to hematoma cavity at 10 o clock   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    random breast   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    tissue adjacent to hematoma at 6 o clock  Specimen E is received in formalin  labeled  right axillary lymph node   non sentinel lymph node  and consists of a single lymph node with some  surrounding adipose tissue measuring 2 x 1 x 0 8cm  The external surface is  brownish tan  The cut surface consists of fatty replacement of the medulla and  thin rim of brownish tan lymphoid tissue  2X all   Specimen F is received in formalin  labeled  right lower chest wall skin  and  consists of an ellipse of skin that is somewhat triangular shaped measuring 3 x  1 5 x 0 2cm  The skin appears grossly unremarkable  as does the subcutaneous  adipose tissue  3X all   Specimen G is received in formalin  labeled  left upper chest wall skin  and  consists of an ellipse of skin measuring 5 x 1 x 0 5cm  The surface of the  skin also appears unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted  2X   Specimen H is received in formalin  labeled  left lower chest wall skin  and  consists of an ellipse of skin that is somewhat triangular measuring 4 x REMOVED_DATE x  0 5cm  The epidermal surface appears unremarkable   Representative sections are embedded  2X   Dictated by  DJF____ signature on file ____DANIEL D  KOELLIKER  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final   ____ signature on file ____DENNIS J  FEEN  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final    report_end  , No.
