een cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 16 06 Consulting Pathologist s   SELIM NASSER  MD GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue   REMOVED_CASE_ID    is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm piece of fatty tissue that is bisected to reveal a 0 8cm in diameter lymph node  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassette A  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast lumpectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm piece of breast tissue  The posterior surface is inked black and the anterior surface is inked blue  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm tan to white mass with a granular surface  The mass is 0 6cm to the anterior margin  1 0cm to the posterior deep margin  1 0cm to the superior margin  and 2 0cm to the inferior margin  The medial margin is submitted in cassette B and the lateral margin is submitted in cassette C  A section of the mass with the superior and anterior margin is submitted in cassette D  A section of the mass with the anterior margin is submitted in cassette E and F  A section of the mass with the posterior margin is submitted in cassette G  An additional section of the breast tissue just lateral to the mass is submitted in cassette H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin inferior half cavity   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm aggregate of breast tissue  pieces  The tissue pieces are inked black and entirely submitted in cassettes I L  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin superior half of cavity le